  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_abs_q7.c ****  * @brief Q7 vector absolute value.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/BasicMathFunctions/arm_abs_q7.c ****  * @param[in]       *pSrc points to the input buffer
